@startuml seq-uc2-breed-lookup
title UC2 Look up a Breed with TheCatAPI: sequence

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber

actor Admin
participant "PetForm" as Form
participant "ManagePetController" as Controller
participant "BreedLookupInteractor\n<<BreedLookupInputBoundary>>" as Interactor
participant "CatApiBreedDataAccess\n<<BreedReferenceDataAccessInterface>>" as DAO
participant "TheCatAPI" as API

Admin -> Form : types a breed, asks to look it up
Form -> Form : start a background task\n(keeps the window responsive)
Form -> Controller : lookupBreed("Siamese")
Controller -> Interactor : lookup("Siamese")
Interactor -> Interactor : check the name is 1 to 30 characters
Interactor -> DAO : findByName("Siamese")
DAO -> API : GET breeds/search?q=Siamese
API --> DAO : matching breeds (JSON)
DAO -> API : download the reference photo
API --> DAO : photo
DAO --> Interactor : BreedReference(name, temperament, photo)
Interactor --> Controller : Optional<BreedReference>
Controller --> Form : BreedReferenceViewData
Form --> Admin : shows typical temperament and photo

note over Form, API
  No exact match: the form says so and the admin continues manually.
  API key missing or the API cannot be reached: the form shows a warning
  and the admin can still fill in the pet manually.
end note

@enduml
